 NASHIOL NYIRONGO — STUDENT 2: Functional Testing (Black Box & White Box)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  ☐ Install and run DreamScape locally
  ☐ Design a minimum of 12 functional test cases
     ☐ Cover valid inputs, invalid inputs, and edge cases
     ☐ Apply Boundary Value Analysis (BVA)
     ☐ Apply Equivalence Partitioning (EP)
  ☐ Identify logic paths in the code (White Box Thinking)
  ☐ Draw a Flow Diagram for ONE selected feature
  ☐ Execute all test cases and record Pass/Fail results
  ☐ Calculate personal QA Metrics:
     ☐ Total Tests Executed
     ☐ Pass Rate (%)
     ☐ Fail Rate (%)
     ☐ Number of Bugs Found
  ☐ Write a brief explanation of ISO 9000 and CMM (Standards Awareness)
  ☐ Write Personal Reflection:
     ☐ Challenges Encountered
     ☐ Key Testing Discoveries
     ☐ Suggested Improvements for Developers
  ☐ Contribute to Final Report (Functional Testing section)
  ☐ Prepare for individual presentation questioning on Student 2 role

